<description><![CDATA[<div>每周的订阅邮件中，我们会附上值得大家阅读的 <a href="?q=%23%E6%8E%A8%E8%8D%90%E6%96%87%E7%AB%A0">#推荐文章</a> 。以下是<a href="https://mailchi.mp/8fc08c5e3d30/k-17456983" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">本周邮件</a>中的推荐阅读列表：<br/><br/>纽约时报 | <a href="https://outsight.pse.is/9uw3e8" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">接近黄仁勋的女间谍由中国国安部招募</a><br/><blockquote>中国国安部招募女商人接近英伟达CEO黄仁勋，试图搜集芯片情报并促成对华芯片出售。</blockquote><br/><br/>端传媒 | <a href="https://outsight.pse.is/9uw3e9" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">从台北市长选举的“黄金交叉”说起：到底如何看民调？</a><br/><blockquote>台北市长选举实际投票率仅约67%，民调中却有高达93%的选民坚称自己一定会去投票。</blockquote><br/><br/>端传媒 | <a href="https://outsight.pse.is/9uw3ea" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">墨尔本中国外卖员遇刺身亡：上千华人集会悼念，追问外送平台责任</a><br/><blockquote>墨尔本一47岁中国外卖员遇刺身亡，身受重伤的他仍走进餐厅取餐，引发上千华人集会悼念。</blockquote><br/><br/>報導者 | <a href="https://outsight.pse.is/9uw3eb" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">【書摘】經歷中共「指居」的恐懼控制，李翹楚：如果不能勇敢的講，就不能自由的行動</a><br/><blockquote>看守晕倒在面前，被关押的李翘楚刚想扶一把，却被旁边人怒吼：“谁允许你动了？”</blockquote><br/><br/>BBC News 中文 | <a href="https://outsight.pse.is/9uw3ec" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">台湾“九合一”选举：四成“陆配”参选遭剔除，身分“法理死结”如何困住参政之路？</a><br/><blockquote>台湾要求当选公职须放弃大陆国籍，但北京不予办理，导致逾四成陆配参选资格被剔除。</blockquote><br/><br/>纽约时报 | <a href="http://cn.nytimes.com/health/20261028/ai-chatgpt-medication-epilepsy-death" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">ChatGPT的致命“用药指导”和一名华人女子的悲剧死亡</a><br/><blockquote>31岁亚马逊女工程师听从ChatGPT劝说秘密停用抗癫痫药，将发病发作当成“大脑低功耗”，最终猝死。</blockquote><br/><br/>欢迎大家推荐我们的邮件周报给身边不方便科学上网的朋友，订阅链接：<a href="https://outsightchina-cn.pages.dev/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">https://outsightchina-cn.pages.dev/</a></div><p><img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/edkBGuDSOUYFmrxHalyal-Rus5J_GikWKHYuOaSkcSYXH-OT9IDEzj_vZc2BDU60mw2U9lLqYjlKPscAcftvPBtmOjp0VzcrvYwfQqdOxLxrrfDh7LMiIFD9s464y2nZowoJDSaIT9NfJqzI_s3JeD42KHLDJWNckWTNj8F47APGbT9ePrGzPZk8qVR7QTPOAWnR9ZKnjF-11tbRb116VUMmm_FiiLuKl0AKpIqfL8P83__heCrKUl4HrAfTMpdsg_kG_aEbVXwiOGUqEDAspR8KUD46FfwogTH75qtsTKw0XH6hrpJAgnULtl7R_2sYnaOG7LbML458RCvX7EKRXg.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/E29DA4.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p>]]></description>
